2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Static\040and\040dynamic\040pressure\040measurements\040on\040a\040NACA\0400012\040airfoil\040in\040the\040Ames\040High\040Reynolds\040Number\040Facility)
/Author (J\056\040B\056\040Mcdevitt\054\040A\056\040F\056\040Okuno)
/Subject (The\040supercritical\040flows\040at\040high\040subsonic\040speeds\040over\040a\040NACA\0400012\040airfoil\040were\040studied\040to\040acquire\040aerodynamic\040data\040suitable\040for\040evaluating\040numerical\055flow\040codes\056\040The\040measurements\040consisted\040primarily\040of\040static\040and\040dynamic\040pressures\040on\040the\040airfoil\040and\040test\055channel\040walls\056\040Shadowgraphs\040were\040also\040taken\040of\040the\040flow\040field\040near\040the\040airfoil\056\040The\040tests\040were\040performed\040at\040free\055stream\040Mach\040numbers\040from\040approximately\0400\0567\040to\0400\0568\054\040at\040angles\040of\040attack\040sufficient\040to\040include\040the\040onset\040of\040buffet\054\040and\040at\040Reynolds\040numbers\040from\0401\040million\040to\04014\040million\056\040A\040test\040action\040was\040designed\040specifically\040to\040obtain\040two\055dimensional\040airfoil\040data\040with\040a\040minimum\040of\040wall\040interference\040effects\056\040Boundary\055layer\040suction\040panels\040were\040used\040to\040minimize\040sidewall\040interference\040effects\056\040Flexible\040upper\040and\040lower\040walls\040allow\040test\055channel\040area\055ruling\040to\040nullify\040Mach\040number\040changes\040induced\040by\040the\040mass\040removal\054\040to\040correct\040for\040longitudinal\040boundary\055layer\040growth\054\040and\040to\040provide\040contouring\040compatible\040with\040the\040streamlines\040of\040the\040model\040in\040free\040air\056)
/Keywords (01\040Jun\0401985\054\040NACA\040airfoil\054\040Drag\040divergence\040Mach\040number\054\040Airfoil\054\040Aerodynamic\040center\054\040Relative\040wind\054\040Ames\040Research\040Center)
>>
endobj
